\\\times 10^{3}$\",\"RHO500\":\"$4.0 \\\\times 10^{51}$\",\n\"N1SRHO\":\"35\",\"N1S\":\"33\",\n\"M60\":\"$3 \\\\times 10^{-4}$\",\"G60\":\"$1.4 \\\\times 10^{8}$\",\"R60\":\"$5.4 \\\\times 10^{8}$\",\n\"DEC60R\":\"12.2\",\"DEC60\":\"11.6\",\n\"M500\":\"above the budget (8 of 20 finished within 60~s)\",\"G500\":\"140.6\",\"R500\":\"192.2\",\n}\nfor k,v in rep.items():\n    assert k in s, k\n    s=s.replace(k,v)\ns=s.replace(\"at $n = 500$ the decision median is above the budget (8 of 20 finished within 60~s) s against\",\"at $n = 500$ the decision median is above the budget (8 of 20 finished within 60~s), against\")\ns=s.replace('''\\\\paragraph{What the solvers did.} CADICALSUMMARY GANAKSUMMARY APPROXSUMMARY''',\n'''\\\\paragraph{What the solvers did.} CaDiCaL's median is under a\nmillisecond up to $n = 80$, 2.5~ms at 100, 58~ms at 200, 1.5~s at 250\nand 3.7~s at 300 (maximum 20.5~s); at 400 it finishes 10 of 20 within\nthe budget and at 500 8 of 20, every finished one satisfiable, which is\nthe known shape of CDCL on random formulas at the threshold (the\nunsatisfiable half is the expensive half). Ganak finishes all 20 up to\n$n = 250$ (median 17.6~s there, maximum 45.7~s), 10 of 20 at 300 and\nnone at 400; its median is flat at 8.3~s and 6.2~s at $n = 100$ and\n150 and lower, 2.4~s, at 200, while its maximum rises throughout ---\nthe plateau looks like a fixed budget inside the binding's\npreprocessing rather than counting difficulty, and we report it as\nmeasured and tuned nothing (\\\\texttt{ETH\\\\_AMBIGUOUS.MD}, 06d). Where the\ncount is positive it is small for the size: at $n = 200$ the fifteen\nsatisfiable instances have between 372 and $2.5 \\\\times 10^{12}$ models\nout of $2^{200}$. ApproxMC finishes all 20 up to $n = 200$ (median\n0.51~s there), 18 at 250, 11 at 300 and none at 400. The sizes at which\nthe three tools leave the budget --- 300 for the counters, 400 for the\ndecision --- are where this measurement ends; nothing is claimed beyond\nthem.''')\ns=s.replace(\"(a median\\nover all twenty with censored runs counted as above the budget, so a\\nmedian is a number whenever at least ten finished)\",\n\"(a median\\nover all twenty with censored runs counted as above the budget, so a\\nmedian is a number whenever more than ten finished)\")\ns=s.replace(\"``sat'' is the number of satisfiable\\ninstances;\",\"``sat'' is the number of satisfiable\\ninstances among those CaDiCaL finished;\")\np.write_text(s)\nimport re\nprint(re.findall(r\"\\b[A-Z]{4,}[0-9A-Z]*\\b\", s)[:20])\nEOF\ngrep -n \"whenever\\|among those\" paper3/latex/sec7_practitioner.tex | head","description":"Fix the figure layout, rebuild, and fill the section's numeric placeholders"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1319,"cache_read_input_tokens":178480,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1319,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"56304e7d-c5a9-41ea-80a7-c4a817bd6f76","uuid":"28fe8701-2ae2-41d4-9ab6-ce0e823accfd","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:02:13.794Z","request_id":"req_011CgjCCrUuET9rzFRtahtV7","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01FoDA46yXzkjHNNgbAQjtiy":{"command":"cd /home/al/dev/MOSP && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport pathlib\np=pathlib.Path(\"paper3/scripts/practitioner.py\"); s=p.read_text()\ns=s.replace('''    axr.yaxis.set_major_locator(LogLocator(base=10, numticks=6))\n    axr.yaxis.set_minor_formatter(NullFormatter())\n    axr.text(52, 1e-4, \"$n = 50$: $\\\\\\\\rho(n) \\\\\\\\geq n$ from here\", fontsize=7, color=INK2, ha=\"left\", va=\"bottom\")\n    axl.legend(loc=\"lower right\", fontsize=6.8, frameon=True, facecolor=\"white\", edgecolor=GRID, borderpad=0.5)\n    fig.supxlabel(\"number of variables $n$ (random 3-CNF, $m = 